              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKU-ISMC's Professor Jonas Otterbeck made the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "news ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://www.kabar.kg/eng/news/professor-from-london-about-his-visit-to-kyrgyzstan/",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "during a recent visit to Kyrgyzstan. Professor Otterbeck attended a conference in Bichkek where he shared his research on Muslim Youth in Sweden. In a wide-ranging interview he spoke about the importance of pluralism and his work at ISMC and his life-long interest in Islam."
            }
          ]
